S. 234, 237-238</a></span>, and <em>Sibron </em>v. <em>New York, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9423756\"><a href=\"/opinion/107730/sibron-v-new-york/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Sibron v. New York\">392 U. S. 40</a></span>, 50-58? The Solicitor General is invited to file a brief expressing the views of the United States and to participate in oral argument.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}